|José Antonio Kast, former deputy and founder of the Republican Party, was proclaimed as the party's presidential candidate on 9 January 2025, running directly in the November election without participating in any opposition primaries.<ref name="radio.uchile.cl" /> He received additional backing from the Christian Social Party on 19 July 2025.<ref name="T13-2025" /> Kast officially registered his candidacy with Servel on 18 August 2025, marking his third bid for the presidency. During his registration, he criticized what he described as a campaign of lies and defamation against him, emphasized the need for economic growth to improve pensions, and highlighted his proposals for public security, social order, and the welfare of animals.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Bravo |first=Nibaldo Pérez |date=18 August 2025 |title=Con críticas al gobierno y la prensa Kast inscribe candidatura ante el Servel: "No les tenemos miedo" |url=https://www.publimetro.cl/noticias/2025/08/18/con-criticas-al-gobierno-y-la-prensa-kast-inscribe-candidatura-ante-el-servel-no-les-tenemos-miedo/ |access-date=19 August 2025 |website=Publimetro Chile |language=es}}</ref>
