|Marco Enríquez-Ominami, former deputy, confirmed on 3 August 2025 that he had collected 36,200 signatures—exceeding the 35,361 required<ref>{{Cite web |last=Castillo |first=Alejandro |date=28 March 2025 |title=¿Qué son los patrocinios para las candidaturas de las Elecciones 2025? |url=https://www.servel.cl/2025/03/28/que-son-los-patrocinios-para-las-candidaturas-de-las-elecciones-2025/ |access-date=16 August 2025 |website=Servicio Electoral de Chile |language=es-CL}}</ref>—to run for president for a fifth time.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Halabi |first=María José |date=3 August 2025 |title="Estaremos en la papeleta": Marco Enríquez-Ominami confirma que recolectó firmas para avanzar en su quinta candidatura presidencial |url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/estaremos-en-la-papeleta-marco-enriquez-ominami-confirma-que-recolecto-firmas-para-avanzar-en-su-quinta-candidatura-presidencial/ |access-date=4 August 2025 |website=La Tercera |language=es}}</ref> In February, he had said he would consider another campaign, calling himself "a political animal" still "in the fight."<ref>{{Cite web |last=Carrillo |first=Constanza |date=21 February 2024 |title=MEO no descarta una quinta candidatura presidencial: "Soy un animal político y estoy en la lucha" |url=https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/nacional/chile/2024/02/21/meo-no-descarta-una-quinta-candidatura-presidencial-soy-un-animal-politico-y-estoy-en-la-lucha.shtml |access-date=26 January 2025 |website=BioBioChile |language=es}}</ref> He officially registered his candidacy with Servel on 18 August 2025 with over 37,000 independent sponsorships, declaring that he personally financed his nationwide tour and online campaign to gather the signatures.<ref name="Arellano-2025" />
