|<ref name="Martínez-2025a">{{Cite web |last=Martínez |first=Roberto |date=18 August 2025 |title=Con jerga deportiva y dando a conocer a integrantes de su equipo: Harold Mayne-Nicholls inscribe su candidatura presidencial ante el Servel |url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/harold-mayne-nicholls-inscribe-su-candidatura-presidencial-ante-el-servel/ |access-date=19 August 2025 |website=La Tercera |language=es}}</ref>
|Harold Mayne-Nicholls, journalist and former president of the [[Asociación Nacional de Fútbol Profesional|ANFP]], confirmed on 16 August 2025 that he had collected the 35,361 signatures required to run for president.<ref>{{Cite web |author=Rodrigo Gómez |date=16 August 2025 |title=Harold Mayne-Nicholls logra reunir firmas para competir en elecciones presidenciales |url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/harold-mayne-nicholls-logra-reunir-firmas-para-competir-en-elecciones-presidenciales/ |access-date=16 August 2025 |website=La Tercera |language=es}}</ref> He officially registered his independent candidacy with Servel on 18 August 2025, presenting members of his team and emphasizing his campaign's focus on security, education, health, and housing.<ref name="Martínez-2025a" /> Mayne-Nicholls has framed his candidacy around dialogue, moderation, and his experience managing major projects such as the [[2023 Pan American Games|Santiago 2023 Pan American Games]].<ref>{{Cite web |date=1 April 2025 |title=Harold Mayne-Nicholls inicia búsqueda de firmas y presenta sus primeros apoyos para presidencial |url=https://www.elmostrador.cl/noticias/pais/2025/04/01/harold-mayne-nicholls-inicia-busqueda-de-firmas-y-presenta-sus-primeros-apoyos-para-presidencial/ |access-date=13 April 2025 |website=El Mostrador |language=es}}</ref>
