== Reactions and aftermath ==
===First round===
Matthei was the first to make a statement after the results were announced, accepting defeat and pledging her support for Kast in the second round.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Silva |first1=M. |title=Matthei reconoce derrota y entrega apoyo a Kast de cara a la segunda vuelta: "Son otros los llamados a avanzar" |url=https://www.emol.com/noticias/Nacional/2025/11/16/1183368/evelyn-matthei-respaldo-kast-balotaje.html |access-date=15 December 2025 |work=[[Emol]] |date=16 November 2025}}</ref><ref name="debate">{{cite news |last1=Paéz |first1=Víctor |title=La comunista Jeannette Jara gana la primera vuelta en Chile y se medirá con Kast el 14 de diciembre |url=https://www.eldebate.com/internacional/20251117/partido-comunista-chile-gana-primera-vuelta-elecciones-presidenciales_355706.html |access-date=15 December 2025 |work=[[ElDebate.com|El Debate]] |date=17 November 2025}}</ref> Kaiser also called for people to vote for Kast in the second round.<ref name="debate" /> President Boric congratulated the winners and called for "a debate with high standards."<ref name="debate" />

===Second round===
In keeping with tradition, outgoing President [[Gabriel Boric]] congratulated President-elect Kast on his victory during a televised phone call.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Rogero |first=Tiago |date=2025-12-14 |title=Ultra-conservative José Antonio Kast elected Chile's next president |url=https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/dec/15/jose-antonio-kast-wins-election-chile-president |access-date=2025-12-15 |work=The Guardian |language=en-GB |issn=0261-3077}}</ref> Kast thanked him for his congratulations and expressed his desire for a "very orderly and respectful" transition, also hoping to hear Boric's views on the country once he assumed the presidency on 11 March 2026.<ref>{{cite news |title=El presidente Boric felicitó a Kast por su "triunfo claro" |url=https://www.dw.com/es/el-presidente-boric-felicit%C3%B3-a-kast-por-su-triunfo-claro/a-75154682 |access-date=15 December 2025 |work=[[Deustche Welle]] |date=14 December 2025}}</ref> 

In his first speech as president-elect, Kast stated that "it wasn't one person who won here, Chile won," and when some members of the audience booed Jara's name, he demanded respect and silence, adding that "she took on a very difficult challenge and gave it her all in her own style until the end, and that, at least for me, is something I value."<ref>{{cite news |title="No ganó una persona, aquí ganó Chile": El primer discurso de Kast como presidente electo |url=https://www.chilevision.cl/noticias/nacional/el-primer-discurso-jose-antonio-kast-presidente-electo-elecciones-2025 |access-date=15 December 2025 |work=[[Chilevisión]] |date=14 December 2025}}</ref>

Jara personally congratulated Kast after his victory.<ref name="infobae">{{cite news |title=Jeannette Jara felicitó a José Antonio Kast por su contundente triunfo electoral en Chile: "El pueblo habló fuerte y claro" |url=https://www.infobae.com/america/america-latina/2025/12/14/jeannette-jara-felicito-a-jose-antonio-kast-por-su-contundente-triunfo-electoral-en-chile-el-pueblo-hablo-fuerte-y-claro/ |access-date=15 December 2025 |work=Infobae |date=15 December 2025}}</ref> In her following public statement, Jara acknowledged defeat and expressed her support for the president-elect "in everything that is good for Chile."<ref name="infobae" /> Kast received a visit from Jara that night at campaign headquarters.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Valenzuela Quiroz |first1=Jeremy |title=José Antonio Kast recibió en su comando a Jeannette Jara tras su victoria en las urnas |url=https://www.latribuna.cl/politica/2025/12/14/jose-antonio-kast-recibio-en-su-comando-a-jeannette-jara-tras-su-victoria-en-las-urnas.html |access-date=16 December 2025 |work={{ill|La Tribuna (Chile)|es}} |date=14 December 2025}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |last1=Rubio |first1=Paz |title=Jeannette Jara se reúne con José Antonio Kast en comando del presidente electo |url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/jeannette-jara-se-reune-con-jose-antonio-kast-en-comando-del-presidente-electo/ |access-date=16 December 2025 |work=La Tercera |date=15 December 2025}}</ref> 

[[File:Gabriel Boric Font, recibe en el Palacio de La Moneda al presidente electo, José Antonio Kast (11).jpg|thumb|right|President Boric with president-elect José Antonio Kast in Palacio de la Moneda, 15 December 2025]]

Kast was congratulated by several international leaders, including Argentine President [[Javier Milei]], Paraguayan President [[Santiago Peña]], Ecuadorian President [[Daniel Noboa]], Bolivian President [[Rodrigo Paz]], Costa Rican President [[Rodrigo Chaves]], Brazilian President [[Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva|Lula da Silva]], Mexican President [[Claudia Sheinbaum]] as well as U.S. Secretary of State [[Marco Rubio]], former Colombian President [[Iván Duque]] and former Ecuadorian President [[Guillermo Lasso]].<ref>{{cite news |title=Líderes internacionales felicitaron a José Antonio Kast por su contundente victoria en las elecciones de Chile |url=https://www.infobae.com/america/america-latina/2025/12/15/lideres-internacionales-felicitaron-a-jose-antonio-kast-por-su-contundente-victoria-en-las-elecciones-de-chile/ |access-date=15 December 2025 |work=[[Infobae]] |date=15 December 2025}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Gobiernos del continente felicitan a José Antonio Kast – DW – 15/12/2025 |url=https://www.dw.com/es/gobiernos-del-continente-felicitan-a-jos%C3%A9-antonio-kast/a-75155310 |access-date=2025-12-16 |website=dw.com |language=es}}</ref> He was also congratuled by Spanish politician and leader of the [[Vox (political party)|Vox]] party [[Santiago Abascal]], Spanish Prime Minister [[Pedro Sánchez]] and by [[Alberto Núñez Feijóo]].<ref>{{cite news |title=Abascal, Feijóo y Sánchez felicitan a Kast por su victoria: «Los chilenos han elegido libertad» |url=https://www.abc.es/espana/abascal-feijoo-sanchez-felicitan-kast-victoria-chilenos-20251215092733-nt.html |access-date=15 December 2025 |work=[[ABC (newspaper)|ABC]] |date=15 December 2025}}</ref>

Colombian President [[Gustavo Petro]] criticized Kast's election harshly, stating "Fascism is advancing. I will never shake hands with a Nazi, nor with the son of a Nazi;{{efn|A reference to Kast's father, [[Michael Kast]], who was a member of the [[Nazi Party]].}} they are death incarnate. It's sad that [[Augusto Pinochet|Pinochet]] had to impose himself by force, but it's even sadder now that people are choosing their own Pinochet."<ref>{{Cite web |last=Sanhueza |first=Diego Stacey, Ana María |date=2025-12-15 |title=Petro repudia con dureza la elección de Kast en Chile: "Jamás le daré la mano a un nazi" |url=https://elpais.com/america-colombia/2025-12-15/petro-repudia-con-dureza-la-eleccion-de-kast-en-chile-jamas-le-dare-la-mano-a-un-nazi.html |access-date=2025-12-16 |website=El País América Colombia |language=es-CO}}</ref> Boric's outgoing government responded to Petro's statements, rejecting them and deciding to file a formal protest.<ref>{{Cite web |first=Mario Alejandro |last=Rodríguez |date=2025-12-15 |title=Gobierno chileno reaccionó a duros mensajes de Gustavo Petro en los que trató a José Antonio Kast de 'nazi': enviará nota de protesta |url=https://www.infobae.com/colombia/2025/12/15/gobierno-chileno-reacciono-a-duros-mensajes-de-gustavo-petro-en-los-que-trato-a-jose-antonio-kast-de-nazi-enviara-nota-de-protesta/ |access-date=2025-12-16 |website=infobae |language=es-ES}}</ref>

The Mapuche Political Platform issued a statement stating that the electoral results "not only signify an electoral defeat for the country's progressive and indigenous forces but also a cultural defeat".<ref>[https://www.elciudadano.com/en/mapuche-political-platform-calls-for-defense-of-indigenous-law-lafkenche-law-and-ilo-convention-169-following-jose-kasts-victory/12/15/ Mapuche Political Platform Calls for Defense of Indigenous Law, Lafkenche Law, and ILO Convention 169 Following José Kast's Victory]</ref>

The following day, on 15 December, President Boric and Kast held a meeting at the [[Palacio de la Moneda]] to prepare for the transfer of power.<ref>{{cite news |title=Boric y Kast se reúnen tras triunfo del ultraderechista |url=https://www.dw.com/es/boric-y-kast-se-re%C3%BAnen-tras-contundente-triunfo-del-ultraderechista/a-75171492 |access-date=16 December 2025 |work=Euronews |date=15 December 2025}}</ref>

===Parliamentary election===
After failing to reach the minimum legal threshold of votes, at least 13 political parties were expected to dissolve, including the longstanding [[Radical Party of Chile|Radical Party]].<ref>{{cite news |last1=Castro |first1=Maolis |title=Los resultados de la elección parlamentaria dejan a 13 partidos fuera del ecosistema político chileno |url=https://elpais.com/chile/2025-11-20/los-resultados-de-la-eleccion-parlamentaria-dejan-a-13-partidos-fuera-del-ecosistema-politico-chileno.html |access-date=16 December 2025 |work=El País |date=20 November 2025}}</ref> The order to do so was given by the [[:es:Servel|Servel]] on 12 February 2026.<ref>{{Cite web |last=León |first=Arturo |date=2026-02-12 |title=Servel ordena la disolución de 13 partidos políticos tras elecciones de diputados 2025 |url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/servel-ordena-la-disolucion-de-13-partidos-politicos-tras-elecciones-de-diputados-2025/ |access-date=2026-10-01 |website=La Tercera |language=es}}</ref>

